    <string name="intro_step">Step %1$d of %2$d</string>
    <string name="intro1_title">Your voice becomes text on your phone</string>
    <string name="intro1_text">Nothing goes to the internet: not the dictations, not the meeting recordings. The recognition model lives on the phone and works without a network.</string>
    <string name="intro2_text">The floating button comes with the keyboard. A tap starts recording, a second one puts the text into the field. Or hold, speak and let go.</string>
    <string name="intro3_text">Record a meeting for hours or bring a ready file. The app lays the speech out by time and separates the voices, and names go into the text.</string>
    <string name="intro4_text">Meetings are sorted into projects, and search looks through every transcript. The result comes out as txt, Markdown, Word and PDF.</string>
